OL,3,ATwo seriously hurt in 30-vehicle crash
OL,4,Aon the M20 in Kent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 vehicles were involved in
OL,7,Fa crash which left two people seriously
OL,8,Finjured on the M20 in Kent on Saturday
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,11,FThe crash happened in foggy conditions
OL,12,Fjust after 18:40 GMT on the
OL,13,FLondon-bound carriageway between
OL,14,Fjunctions eight (Maidstone) and nine
OL,15,F(Ashford).
OL,17,FParamedics attended to 11 people, and
OL,18,Ftwo were taken to hospital, Kent Fire
OL,19,Fand Rescue Service said.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
